  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在北平与青岛住家的时候，我永远没想到过：将来我要住在什么地方去。",
      "output_sha256": "f19493a74d24237ef07a4a8ea84c7c57c2a872343c6b62e18ebab2e61de0f2be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "f19493a74d24237ef07a4a8ea84c7c57c2a872343c6b62e18ebab2e61de0f2be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在乐园里的人或者不会梦想另辟乐园吧。",
      "output_sha256": "a60c093e9857321fe1bcfa8567d532afca296fb8f4050fdaead65321d5917c7e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "a60c093e9857321fe1bcfa8567d532afca296fb8f4050fdaead65321d5917c7e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在抗战期间，我在重庆及其周边生活了六年。",
      "output_sha256": "22c29aff2be7182b4f9ea84b14ad40302c0dc306bbbd2befdaf27d1615a1ae73",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.510244,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7bfce160c7b5dfea7b4c5ba0b323c0f8a9a35159e49922d02a5d65a6645ab9a0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "22c29aff2be7182b4f9ea84b14ad40302c0dc306bbbd2befdaf27d1615a1ae73",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那段时间的炎热与雾霭，以及房屋的破旧，让我开始做梦。",
      "output_sha256": "2dfe5c49ca4a8f08902673ffcc898ac3cbef6c300c88b2e5f6b511b4129ef3d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.371304,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bbc1dddadd8ba3e7748f2248c4b3555c5fdab73f9b634113848a4d54b40a4bcc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2dfe5c49ca4a8f08902673ffcc898ac3cbef6c300c88b2e5f6b511b4129ef3d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我梦想着抗战胜利后我应去住的地方。",
      "output_sha256": "2fad5d75361ccaef63208d8b6330072fb56699adb400458c06b8db6c712185aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "2fad5d75361ccaef63208d8b6330072fb56699adb400458c06b8db6c712185aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "无论我的梦想能否成真，谈论这些总是令人愉快的：",
      "output_sha256": "f33f3ef27e6da9010d74c1ddba0a83535abb0edb22a347700dd465c690c68af3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.500613,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2477a5920497c64b4f66fad8d8c32a2a1849efc470df5001d7a216281de86247"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f33f3ef27e6da9010d74c1ddba0a83535abb0edb22a347700dd465c690c68af3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "春天，我将要住在杭州。",
      "output_sha256": "57a67380c4a43ad21462d630994dca46fdbb2ad1b28a366043911bc0c8bdd42e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "57a67380c4a43ad21462d630994dca46fdbb2ad1b28a366043911bc0c8bdd42e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二十年前，我到过杭州，只住了两天。",
      "output_sha256": "d04cf47cde3f73314f31fd2d01344ef51368f390b0a528ce365ea4406ccde441",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "d04cf47cde3f73314f31fd2d01344ef51368f390b0a528ce365ea4406ccde441",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那是农历二月初，我在西湖看到了嫩柳与菜花，碧波与翠竹。",
      "output_sha256": "d53d6aca755d793ba6b0d29f93a22eab26ff7a809d2d99673a0ed1d3fcdbe659",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.681044,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "929cc8733a248b61023e110a741b229ba0dbd6b6c28d123134e7e07dbaef38ba"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d53d6aca755d793ba6b0d29f93a22eab26ff7a809d2d99673a0ed1d3fcdbe659",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "山上的光景如何？",
      "output_sha256": "ec817f1a336b6aed4b592f7dd18ac8cbe6a2af7a13098dca42a901d9fe990ac3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "ec817f1a336b6aed4b592f7dd18ac8cbe6a2af7a13098dca42a901d9fe990ac3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "没有看到。",
      "output_sha256": "66a625b90d37e346bd7f62950acfa5668f8017df173f38e88af69ceb6808a6e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "66a625b90d37e346bd7f62950acfa5668f8017df173f38e88af69ceb6808a6e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "三四月的莺花山水也无从得知。",
      "output_sha256": "c165968a63423a5fab0f8d24344d63fd485d37af078a0467619a391abb47f1c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.742871,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8f27b502ce2afb06c7da695e7e0c34f0665587a87f353f3d406a57063c790fae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c165968a63423a5fab0f8d24344d63fd485d37af078a0467619a391abb47f1c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，凭我所见的那点春色，已足以让我相信杭州的春天必定能让人沉浸在诗与画的世界里。",
      "output_sha256": "85f1a3d98b0eb82dc0ecfe0c4283bcbf5d7f86443aa3d70cda0b0496d7b3a065",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.514223,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0959c01529216f26a45ea9c913468923810613c203ba09a7240e97aeed6c3de8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "85f1a3d98b0eb82dc0ecfe0c4283bcbf5d7f86443aa3d70cda0b0496d7b3a065",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以，春天我的家应当是在杭州。",
      "output_sha256": "b8503a91bb5b577ed7cbe9c68448491bf236ead69e55fff28f3329e744971776",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "b8503a91bb5b577ed7cbe9c68448491bf236ead69e55fff28f3329e744971776",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "夏天，我想青城山应当算作最理想的地方。",
      "output_sha256": "7711a30d14cbd4a6803e58d76788479af2cfed1cbd1d29d15b5d3d9834e0d7ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "7711a30d14cbd4a6803e58d76788479af2cfed1cbd1d29d15b5d3d9834e0d7ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在那里，我虽然只住过十天，可是它的幽静已拴住了我的心灵。",
      "output_sha256": "2f20de879d1c76ca5ccc665b7995efcb69d32e2d325b1f7b29272e034e840168",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f20de879d1c76ca5ccc665b7995efcb69d32e2d325b1f7b29272e034e840168",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在我所看见过的山水中，只有这里没有使我失望。",
      "output_sha256": "f34a2cd8241a2381aa5bc54504982e7414c96ba27118ce274c8fdac4a1c07fe1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "f34a2cd8241a2381aa5bc54504982e7414c96ba27118ce274c8fdac4a1c07fe1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "它并没有什么奇峰或巨瀑，也没有多少古寺与胜迹，可是，它的那一片绿色已足使我感到这是仙人所应住的地方了。",
      "output_sha256": "143547dd58567b2395a602c4dd2b71692de1d68c9c54521a5c5b803806328313",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "143547dd58567b2395a602c4dd2b71692de1d68c9c54521a5c5b803806328313",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "到处都是绿，而且都是像嫩柳那么淡，竹叶那么亮，蕉叶那么润，目之所及，那片淡而光润的绿色都在轻轻的颤动，仿佛要流入空中与心中去似的。",
      "output_sha256": "81ac4ad4a6af35d1d4dd2af2d50dbf6c27d81abd94432e1dc584ed2e5d492836",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "81ac4ad4a6af35d1d4dd2af2d50dbf6c27d81abd94432e1dc584ed2e5d492836",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这个绿色会像音乐似的，涤清了心中的万虑，山中有水，有茶，还有酒。",
      "output_sha256": "a53adce9645f0b9aa87fffbf6b7c8190e66bcdb63d05c2330c281d6d4a5bc6c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "a53adce9645f0b9aa87fffbf6b7c8190e66bcdb63d05c2330c281d6d4a5bc6c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "即使在炎热的夏季，早晚也需穿上毛衣。",
      "output_sha256": "7d3e0fc4b987d568951a69e7ec287e47b8b176b9c7b29cb9d1a2a3d148d7c007",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.456915,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a8ade61fac8867f9d93d786629389231aca871b817ad1a3e600ef038f5e9c6ab"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7d3e0fc4b987d568951a69e7ec287e47b8b176b9c7b29cb9d1a2a3d148d7c007",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想，在这里住一夏天，必能写出一部十万到二十万的小说。",
      "output_sha256": "e3fd8fe98fe7abf493830639747e49ab28fe844b22c94a1f91009be4b50268f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "e3fd8fe98fe7abf493830639747e49ab28fe844b22c94a1f91009be4b50268f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若青城去不成，求其次者才提到青岛。",
      "output_sha256": "42dcfe6a58ba0be3a773365bcb95297676c5010d2c5d99441609dbf0882b6d8d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "42dcfe6a58ba0be3a773365bcb95297676c5010d2c5d99441609dbf0882b6d8d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我在青岛住过三年，很喜爱它。",
      "output_sha256": "3dd323d0d4489b8347aabc764a91805059854932e44739544d8c10a765d65a45",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "3dd323d0d4489b8347aabc764a91805059854932e44739544d8c10a765d65a45",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不过，春夏之交时常有雾，虽然气温不算高，却相当湿闷。",
      "output_sha256": "1d1c24813fb250271c984bd20fb4a2e5b148762a4e3372d177c6af003b604aaa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.626637,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "03011b64612675eaf11c80033d1e70c516c79b686483381af51f2dfdb12129a5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1d1c24813fb250271c984bd20fb4a2e5b148762a4e3372d177c6af003b604aaa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再说，一到夏天，游人来的很多，失去了海滨上的清静。",
      "output_sha256": "96b64b071dce78ac3893b4f7a818401f812cc0f9f814683bf8865edfb72b8f09",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "96b64b071dce78ac3893b4f7a818401f812cc0f9f814683bf8865edfb72b8f09",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "美而不静便至少失去一半的美。",
      "output_sha256": "f3d246ebf2dc23c4127bd91e1f01368becd59ea16cad63dc27c080864999f590",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "f3d246ebf2dc23c4127bd91e1f01368becd59ea16cad63dc27c080864999f590",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "最让我不悦的是那些喝醉的外国水兵和几乎赤裸、缺乏曲线美的妓女。",
      "output_sha256": "1e410af8962974fc07c9a449ffaa62abe13bc5808a2342bfcf5206c71f72a8df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.593414,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "32f6bb92ec4c19ae6f948957a40c421f6aab67bb3dc5e08545139c3838130746"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1e410af8962974fc07c9a449ffaa62abe13bc5808a2342bfcf5206c71f72a8df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "秋天，游客都离去，这里反而显得更加迷人。",
      "output_sha256": "f96e80ef7b71444b58ec226d4a68752fa48cf1009f1355e70c19ff2ca72602f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.343016,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1ba6b54662c49f5f9ce6126bbb9b86957fa12a80418a5f54821504b980514a2b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f96e80ef7b71444b58ec226d4a68752fa48cf1009f1355e70c19ff2ca72602f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不过，秋天一定要住北平。",
      "output_sha256": "d71f49abcf4f581354274c3afd2fb775866204f8f32843f36a48e491e3d6d45b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "d71f49abcf4f581354274c3afd2fb775866204f8f32843f36a48e491e3d6d45b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至于天堂是什么样子，我并不清楚，但根据我的生活经验，北平的秋天就像天堂。",
      "output_sha256": "0a643cd1369b7d883fd346dd84c3df026c9bb2eeb4cb63f6cd2b0c4e5da6e458",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.603533,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f26819e3b9bf0a292248ce5ea58e85758ea50f0c76daddb5b647c759eeb1a00e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0a643cd1369b7d883fd346dd84c3df026c9bb2eeb4cb63f6cd2b0c4e5da6e458",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "论天气，不冷不热。",
      "output_sha256": "db13aa6ff0f06ba626249c1c9ad98b7367f91352f8695ff05c6444813af9fb25",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "db13aa6ff0f06ba626249c1c9ad98b7367f91352f8695ff05c6444813af9fb25",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "论吃食，苹果，梨，柿，枣，葡萄，都每样有若干种。",
      "output_sha256": "32229e9384de746611463b8819e7e4827bc6383f0abe34a455a3c24541443df5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "32229e9384de746611463b8819e7e4827bc6383f0abe34a455a3c24541443df5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "北平特产的小白梨和大白海棠，恐怕就是乐园中的禁果，连亚当与夏娃见了也会垂涎欲滴！",
      "output_sha256": "0b1868fc872b479026f5f1c77fd072f6ca45f23423f4cd9ab65ab0c3b01f0374",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.749719,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "393d1cbcd1257ef6835bf91238b7769c4d933b969a95d295d193647464e61c08"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0b1868fc872b479026f5f1c77fd072f6ca45f23423f4cd9ab65ab0c3b01f0374",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "果子而外，羊肉正肥，高粱红的螃蟹刚好下市，而良乡的栗子也香闻十里。",
      "output_sha256": "e898b5156f20ee485e087fbbbc13b4b9cb76c394368343e21bfe7d1686277378",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "e898b5156f20ee485e087fbbbc13b4b9cb76c394368343e21bfe7d1686277378",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "论花草，菊花种类之多，花式之奇，可以甲天下。",
      "output_sha256": "64e65fcd5758a8f6454a364876f66e72228be5b8072e334f2b9edf2b2ff45e56",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "64e65fcd5758a8f6454a364876f66e72228be5b8072e334f2b9edf2b2ff45e56",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "西山的红叶可见，北海可以划船——虽然荷花已残，但荷叶依然散发着清香。",
      "output_sha256": "b36e984ef2e62ac6b00bd70d2caf6c3da00ae7d1ed94fa99ddbe3df3f4d31684",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.715472,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6b09f08050ade06dda460dada768542e94f6bd32238e65b3df100b0323bcf1d7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b36e984ef2e62ac6b00bd70d2caf6c3da00ae7d1ed94fa99ddbe3df3f4d31684",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在北平的秋天，生活的方方面面都令人满意。",
      "output_sha256": "aae91d52657a89519319e07a5482f2f5670a17da8df4ba3432413212471e02c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.474121,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aa3e4dbb4b31d5f15d936a54a488994c0b37e7ccded0450f06183103414d6bf1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aae91d52657a89519319e07a5482f2f5670a17da8df4ba3432413212471e02c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "即使没有余钱买菊吃蟹，一两毛钱还可以爆二两羊肉，弄一小壶佛手露啊！",
      "output_sha256": "0a0dac5ade6cbc0890c26e8b1a3045d2b191fdcfece5867e22daf02b79cec7a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a0dac5ade6cbc0890c26e8b1a3045d2b191fdcfece5867e22daf02b79cec7a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "冬天，我尚未做出决定，香港温暖，适合我这个怕冷的人居住，但“洋味”太浓，我不太愿意去。",
      "output_sha256": "aa5a6f09452e1f619cba4c61344fb01a4a45e3655f8b738f41e61370e78f97d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.523115,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cfbc3cec125432bdb0a780c809597efb9884c4011f27c452b6f11ec93122f812"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aa5a6f09452e1f619cba4c61344fb01a4a45e3655f8b738f41e61370e78f97d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "广州，我没有到过，无从判断。",
      "output_sha256": "6c917f83552e91fe47bec8d717c0ac87346f1332b50fcb3821c461ee98ffe0df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "6c917f83552e91fe47bec8d717c0ac87346f1332b50fcb3821c461ee98ffe0df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "成都或者相当的合适，虽然并不怎样和暖，可是为了水仙，素心腊梅，各色的茶花，与红梅绿梅，仿佛就受一点寒冷，也颇值得去了。",
      "output_sha256": "68f287cd594c5f668c881c44281b490b0fae055f016b1fb1618e717b71155a1c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "68f287cd594c5f668c881c44281b490b0fae055f016b1fb1618e717b71155a1c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "昆明的花卉很多，天气也比成都好，然而旧书铺与精致又便宜的小吃远不如成都多，单看花而无法阅读似乎也有些遗憾。",
      "output_sha256": "5e517e4811f1ff5568dc1066d5233c230ef2f611960502996d97b20baef098ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.590416,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "756758c0205dd32866a4fe79ec6de0dbb30e6187e41af6292b7c6e90b982f5a5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5e517e4811f1ff5568dc1066d5233c230ef2f611960502996d97b20baef098ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好吧，就暂时这么规定：冬天不住成都便住昆明吧。",
      "output_sha256": "13224e819b617853edd41f4930519e805ab33943ea6c13299b6b0b9f4b6d0370",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "13224e819b617853edd41f4930519e805ab33943ea6c13299b6b0b9f4b6d0370",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在抗战期间，我未能发国难财。",
      "output_sha256": "bcffe1f2cbe94b565504b83da6165f7d4ab9009949c4d0049ba983b89e363488",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.650735,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "29b7d89fe564e583bfcdc497014ceff0cb6038b8c5a3583014afe3b62d0e2701"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bcffe1f2cbe94b565504b83da6165f7d4ab9009949c4d0049ba983b89e363488",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我想，抗战结束后，我一定会富裕起来，唯一的原因就是我在这里做梦。",
      "output_sha256": "eaf41d693c917204e9eeeea1cef642e151ab5f008590dab3720168029722ee79",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.679915,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c5a2adfa39653ffe53521cb98800eeb702dfa7958e78f2728ee835186ff57a0e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eaf41d693c917204e9eeeea1cef642e151ab5f008590dab3720168029722ee79",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "既然阔起来，我就能在杭州，青城山，北平，成都，都盖起一所中式的小三合房，自己住三间，其余的留给友人们住。",
      "output_sha256": "d6bc386f14f73d19149b9983b1eaa4e3c37c1a23b1d2a90811875508b49655f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6bc386f14f73d19149b9983b1eaa4e3c37c1a23b1d2a90811875508b49655f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "房后都有起码是二亩大的一个花园，种满了花草；住客有随便折花的，便毫不客气的赶出去。",
      "output_sha256": "a96f32fb587b2e5f397c053ea5b4a8fdb4d92c8022241327d630ee7decfeb3fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "a96f32fb587b2e5f397c053ea5b4a8fdb4d92c8022241327d630ee7decfeb3fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青岛与昆明也各建小房一所，作为候补住宅。",
      "output_sha256": "d4f11a23bbc7347bbed49818af3ff4958d42196c6d58a32721e4d0bee5d2acfe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4f11a23bbc7347bbed49818af3ff4958d42196c6d58a32721e4d0bee5d2acfe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "各处的小宅，不管是什么材料盖成的，一律叫作“不会草堂”——在抗战中，开会开够了，所以永远“不会”。",
      "output_sha256": "682f338896657c374f0ce0d15cdca4a13210d49a7b663c502e5d7dde1f4c7896",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "682f338896657c374f0ce0d15cdca4a13210d49a7b663c502e5d7dde1f4c7896",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那时候，飞机一定很方便，我想四季搬家也许不至于受多大苦处的。",
      "output_sha256": "56374703b4ccd092e1785e9f1fd29156eef24151982ef12f9b485b86f1a78ef2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "56374703b4ccd092e1785e9f1fd29156eef24151982ef12f9b485b86f1a78ef2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若那时候飞机减价，一二百元就能买一架的话，我就自备一架，择黄道吉日慢慢的飞行。",
      "output_sha256": "ee265dbd3cf749b167174cd06c2ad60f8b4933538bc7934bd82abb7d02e9e919",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee265dbd3cf749b167174cd06c2ad60f8b4933538bc7934bd82abb7d02e9e919",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
